 the figure." :question/worked-solution "From the diagram, we get the vectors\n\n$$\n\\text{u}=⟨3,2⟩,\\,\\text{v}=⟨2,-2⟩.\n$$\n\nFirst, we construct a matrix where the columns are made up of the components of the corresponding vectors:\n\n$$\nM=[\\begin{aligned}3 & 2 \\\\ 2 & -2\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nThen, we find the determinant:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}det(M) & =|\\begin{aligned}3 & 2 \\\\ 2 & -2\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =3\\cdot (-2)-2\\cdot 2 \\\\  & =-10\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe absolute value of $det(M)$ gives the area $A$ of the parallelogram:\n\n$$\nA=|-10\\,|=10\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-13944/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "288e49b0-f706-54de-86b7-a17248fe2408"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-13944"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-320414/field-1/2fa5baf88b61736a3022c72e24e172fda2b4270fffff6efaa1fc03fef23fccc2" :answer/id #uuid "a1febe55-9388-5935-be82-8638fbfc1303" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "26" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-320414/field-1" :answer-field/id #uuid "0be4675c-ec1c-5914-a675-19ea56bb7d63" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "q-320414/field-1/2fa5baf88b61736a3022c72e24e172fda2b4270fffff6efaa1fc03fef23fccc2" :answer-field/choices ["q-320414/field-1/2fa5baf88b61736a3022c72e24e172fda2b4270fffff6efaa1fc03fef23fccc2"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-320414" :question/id #uuid "9b66f910-5a64-5418-84e8-a9c1f64a8580" :question/math-academy-id "q-320414" :question/problem "Determine the area $A$ of the parallelogram spanned by $\\text{u}=⟨5,-3⟩$ and $\\text{v}=⟨-2,-4⟩.$\n\n$\\,\\,A=$ {{field-1}}" :question/worked-solution "First, we construct a matrix where the columns are made up of the components of the corresponding vectors:\n\n$$\nM=[\\begin{aligned}5 & -2 \\\\ -3 & -4\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nThen, we find the determinant:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}det(M) & =|\\begin{aligned}5 & -2 \\\\ -3 & -4\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =5\\cdot (-4)-(-2)\\cdot (-3) \\\\  & =-20-6 \\\\  & =-26\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe absolute value of $det(M)$ gives the area $A$ of the parallelogram:\n\n$$\nA=|\\,-26\\,|=26\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-320414/field-1"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "288e49b0-f706-54de-86b7-a17248fe2408"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-320414"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-13951/selection/85f23a53be0e95a7e191561cc5a77501369717526aae5254cc8d13ed8080d997" :answer/id #uuid "77086d2f-6cf5-5165-a066-3de3857f04c7" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "52" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-13951/selection/0f0db3a18f1d79c4863315eefe754cc5306e04e7aeebf4414ffedb95d6f1bc97" :answer/id #uuid "4b4344ad-bea7-591b-9d9a-9df93765c2d4" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "12" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-13951/selection/2671fdc3a44bd3421ded09be4e881743067a96eb4e584e442a30f737593eae71" :answer/id #uuid "dd3a11c5-b8fb-5f37-b8fa-32abeabab61a" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "38" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-13951/selection/abe476e447976564bc5c670fe73789666287b967d49bbed12b1d85144449e63e" :answer/id #uuid "6635e871-6a52-54ec-86f9-11b20903fd57" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "23" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-13951/selection/d971375f57c56d8a55a09f2b892e108787b055ceeadf005d7beed73e388cc467" :answer/id #uuid "9cb8f280-d04d-5ed7-8775-e4e765364d87" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "0" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-13951/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "c5822dda-c371-5b0e-b20e-832764f977ca" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-13951/selection/abe476e447976564bc5c670fe73789666287b967d49bbed12b1d85144449e63e" :answer-field/choices ["q-13951/selection/85f23a53be0e95a7e191561cc5a77501369717526aae5254cc8d13ed8080d997" "q-13951/selection/0f0db3a18f1d79c4863315eefe754cc5306e04e7aeebf4414ffedb95d6f1bc97" "q-13951/selection/2671fdc3a44bd3421ded09be4e881743067a96eb4e584e442a30f737593eae71" "q-13951/selection/abe476e447976564bc5c670fe73789666287b967d49bbed12b1d85144449e63e" "q-13951/selection/d971375f57c56d8a55a09f2b892e108787b055ceeadf005d7beed73e388cc467"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-13951" :question/id #uuid "7fe54472-016d-51ca-b2f6-6543f7ec9396" :question/math-academy-id "q-13951" :question/problem "Calculate the area of the parallelogram spanned by $\\text{u}=[\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ -4\\end{aligned}]$ and $\\text{v}=[\\begin{aligned}5 \\\\ 3\\end{aligned}].$" :question/worked-solution "First, we construct a matrix where the columns are made up of the components of the corresponding vectors:\n\n$$\nM=[\\begin{aligned}1 & 5 \\\\ -4 & 3\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nThen, we find the determinant:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}det(M) & =|\\begin{aligned}1 & 5 \\\\ -4 & 3\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =1\\cdot 3-5\\cdot (-4) \\\\  & =23\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe absolute value of $det(M)$ gives the area $A$ of the parallelogram:\n\n$$\nA=|\\,23\\,|=23\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-13951/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "288e49b0-f706-54de-86b7-a17248fe2408"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-13951"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-320402/field-1/12b7d840a997b0af25896f37c76d366155c72a970c1525c62ec119b69786f393" :answer/id #uuid "a11aae4e-eb2a-53b9-b729-aa97885f2131" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "13" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-320402/field-1" :answer-field/id #uuid "04afbf7d-4faa-596d-aa8f-7adff8c73e30" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "q-320402/field-1/12b7d840a997b0af25896f37c76d366155c72a970c1525c62ec119b69786f393" :answer-field/choices ["q-320402/field-1/12b7d840a997b0af25896f37c76d366155c72a970c1525c62ec119b69786f393"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-320402" :question/id #uuid "274e3fef-d560-53be-a236-cc5dab5cc853" :question/math-academy-id "q-320402" :question/problem "Determine the area $A$ of the parallelogram spanned by $\\text{u}=[\\begin{aligned}3 \\\\ -1\\end{aligned}]$ and $\\text{v}=[\\begin{aligned}-2 \\\\ 5\\end{aligned}].$\n\n$\\,\\,A=$ {{field-1}}" :question/worked-solution "First, we construct a matrix where the columns are made up of the components of the corresponding vectors:\n\n$$\nM=[\\begin{aligned}3 & -2 \\\\ -1 & 5\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nThen, we find the determinant:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}det(M) & =|\\begin{aligned}3 & -2 \\\\ -1 & 5\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =3\\cdot 5-(-2)\\cdot (-1) \\\\  & =15-2 \\\\  & =13\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe absolute value of $det(M)$ gives the area $A$ of the parallelogram:\n\n$$\nA=|\\,13\\,|=13\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-320402/field-1"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "288e49b0-f706-54de-86b7-a17248fe2408"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-320402"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-320557/field-1/219833e72de92bafe4f4f5813822a337104a6b771fd9bf741ddcca8750ecab9e" :answer/id #uuid "74b714eb-784b-5de9-975f-fc0390650a1b" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "4\\sqrt{2}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-320557/field-1/af5580a233ee3709064249d6732fc822dfb93f38caf90c025deb51b127e90b2c" :answer/id #uuid "355fc3ad-9f1d-52ab-8a17-d95b52098427" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "2\\sqrt{2}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-320557/field-1" :answer-field/id #uuid "08592ac8-726f-534c-84c0-8a8e8dd42c78" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "q-320557/field-1/219833e72de92bafe4f4f5813822a337104a6b771fd9bf741ddcca8750ecab9e" :answer-field/choices ["q-320557/field-1/219833e72de92bafe4f4f5813822a337104a6b771fd9bf741ddcca8750ecab9e" "q-320557/field-1/af5580a233ee3709064249d6732fc822dfb93f38caf90c025deb51b127e90b2c"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-320557" :question/id #uuid "f2a974ab-e642-5854-9835-4feb37d0563f" :question/math-academy-id "q-320557" :question/problem "Given that the area spanned between the vectors $\\text{u}=[\\begin{aligned}2\\sqrt{2} \\\\ 3\\end{aligned}]$ and $\\text{v}=[\\begin{aligned}a \\\\ 6\\end{aligned}]$ equals zero, what is the value of $a?$\n\n$a=$\n{{field-1}}" :question/worked-solution "First, we construct a matrix where the columns are made up of the components of the corresponding vectors:\n\n$$\nM=[\\begin{aligned}2\\sqrt{2} & a \\\\ 3 & 6\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nThen, we find the determinant:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}det(M) & =|\\begin{aligned}2\\sqrt{2} & a \\\\ 3 & 6\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =(2\\sqrt{2})\\cdot 6-a\\cdot 3 \\\\  & =12\\sqrt{2}-3a\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, setting the expression for the determinant equal to $0$ and solving for $a,$ we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}12\\sqrt{2}-3a & =0 \\\\ -3a & =-12\\sqrt{2} \\\\ a & =4\\sqrt{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-320557/field-1"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "0272b8d6-8400-5a6d-b51d-fc6ca84bd166"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-320557"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-102756/selection/d971375f57c56d8a55a09f2b892e108787b055ceeadf005d7beed73e388cc467" :answer/id #uuid "2c2513b6-5bd4-596a-b8b5-3f0fce6a7d85" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "0" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-102756/selection/af5580a233ee3709064249d6732fc822dfb93f38caf90c025deb51b127e90b2c" :answer/id #uuid "d11abbc5-22d1-58ba-b8ef-dfee3708ec00" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "2\\sqrt{2}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-102756/selection/be9eb51cc2